  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p>Very simple mod that was difficult to figure out how to implement thanks to how Unity and BSG handles audio sources.</p>\n<p>Use the BepInEx F12 config menu to change the volume (0-100%) of the faceshield breathing sound.</p>\n<p>Known issue: If you have faceshield on when loading into a raid, you will still hear the heavy breathing play out <strong>ONCE</strong> but will be silent from then onwards (I probably won’t fix this)</p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO INSTALL:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the mod</li>\n<li>Open the mod zip with 7-Zip (not WinRAR)</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the “BepInEx” folder straight into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n",
